        "content": "Where Heritage Meets Modern Design",
        "as": "h2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "about-iwt-story-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "content": "Founded in Cleveland, Ohio in 2013, ModernCre8ve marries modern design with the world-class execution of old-world Amish craftsmen. Every piece is handmade one at a time using domestic-sourced hardwood lumber."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "about-iwt-story-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "content": "What started as a passion project quickly grew into a studio dedicated to creating furniture that honors both form and function. We believe great design should be accessible, built to last, and made with integrity."
      }
    },
