        "content": "Built to Last, Designed to Inspire",
        "as": "h2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "about-iwt-phil-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "content": "We believe furniture should be more than functional \u2014 it should tell a story. Every grain pattern, every joint, every finish is chosen with intention. Our mid-century modern, Scandinavian, and Japandi-inspired designs bring warmth and character to modern spaces."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "about-iwt-phil-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "content": "By working directly with Amish craftsmen in Ohio, we maintain the highest standards of quality while keeping our process sustainable and our prices fair. No middlemen, no mass production \u2014 just honest furniture made the right way."
      }
    },
